slug: "social-notifier"
title: "Social Media Notifier"
category: "social"
excerpt: "Get automatic notifications when creators go live or post new content on YouTube, Twitch, Twitter, TikTok, Bluesky, or Reddit."
tags: ["notifier","youtube","twitch","twitter","tiktok","bluesky","reddit","notifications","social media"]
